#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Control and query the Apple keyboard monitor"
msgstr "Apple キーボード監視の制御と照会"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Control and query the Apple keyboard monitor (apple-kb-monitord).\n"
"\n"
"The Fn mode is a parameter of the hid_apple kernel module: it applies to ALL "
"Apple keyboards connected to this computer, not to a single one. Changing it "
"requires administrator rights (polkit authentication)."
msgstr ""
"Apple キーボード監視 (apple-kb-monitord) の制御と照会。\n"
"\n"
"Fn モードはカーネルモジュール hid_apple のパラメーターです。1 台だけではな"
"く、このコンピューターに接続されたすべての Apple キーボードに適用されます。変"
"更には管理者権限 (polkit 認証) が必要です。"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"EXIT CODES:\n"
"  0   success\n"
"  1   error (D-Bus failure, write refused, bad data)\n"
"  2   daemon absent (apple-kb-monitord not on the session bus)\n"
"  64  usage error (invalid arguments)\n"
"\n"
"FN MODES (hid_apple.fnmode, global to every Apple keyboard):\n"
"  0  disabled   Fn key has no effect\n"
"  1  fkeyslast  media keys by default, Fn+Fx = F-key\n"
"  2  fkeysfirst F-keys by default, Fn+Fx = media key\n"
"  3  auto       kernel default: = 1 on an Apple keyboard\n"
"  4  fkeysdisabled F-keys disabled (media keys only)"
msgstr ""
"終了コード:\n"
"  0   成功\n"
"  1   エラー (D-Bus の失敗、書き込み拒否、不正なデータ)\n"
"  2   サービスなし (セッションバス上に apple-kb-monitord がない)\n"
"  64  使い方の誤り (不正な引数)\n"
"\n"
"FN モード (hid_apple.fnmode、すべての Apple キーボードに共通):\n"
"  0  disabled   Fn キーは無効\n"
"  1  fkeyslast  既定でメディアキー、Fn+Fx = F キー\n"
"  2  fkeysfirst 既定で F キー、Fn+Fx = メディアキー\n"
"  3  auto       カーネルの既定: Apple キーボードでは = 1\n"
"  4  fkeysdisabled F キー無効 (メディアキーのみ)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print help (see more with '--help')"
msgstr "ヘルプを表示 ('--help' で詳細)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print help (see a summary with '-h')"
msgstr "ヘルプを表示 ('-h' で概要)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print version"
msgstr "バージョンを表示"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Show keyboard state (battery, connection, RSSI, Fn mode)"
msgstr "キーボードの状態を表示 (電池、接続、RSSI、Fn モード)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Machine-readable JSON (schema 1) on a single line"
msgstr "機械可読な JSON (スキーマ 1) を 1 行で出力"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print help"
msgstr "ヘルプを表示"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Read a setting"
msgstr "設定を読み取る"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Current Fn mode (0-4), read from /sys/module/hid_apple/parameters/fnmode"
msgstr ""
"現在の Fn モード (0-4)、/sys/module/hid_apple/parameters/fnmode から読み取り"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "hid_apple parameters (all of them, or one)"
msgstr "hid_apple のパラメーター (すべて、または 1 つ)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)"
msgstr "このメッセージ、または指定したサブコマンドのヘルプを表示"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Change a setting (administrator authentication required)"
msgstr "設定を変更 (管理者認証が必要)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Set the Fn mode of hid_apple (0-4). Global to ALL Apple keyboards; asks for "
"administrator authentication through polkit (pkexec akm-helper)"
msgstr ""
"hid_apple の Fn モード (0-4) を設定。すべての Apple キーボードに共通。polkit "
"(pkexec akm-helper) で管理者認証を求めます"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "0 disabled, 1 fkeyslast, 2 fkeysfirst, 3 auto, 4 fkeysdisabled"
msgstr "0 disabled、1 fkeyslast、2 fkeysfirst、3 auto、4 fkeysdisabled"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Also write it to /etc/modprobe.d/hid_apple.conf so it survives reboots"
msgstr "再起動後も保持されるよう /etc/modprobe.d/hid_apple.conf にも書き込む"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Set a hid_apple parameter (fnmode 0-4, iso_layout -1..1, swap_opt_cmd 0-2, "
"swap_ctrl_cmd 0-1, swap_fn_leftctrl 0-1). Global to ALL Apple keyboards"
msgstr ""
"hid_apple のパラメーターを設定 (fnmode 0-4、iso_layout -1..1、swap_opt_cmd "
"0-2、swap_ctrl_cmd 0-1、swap_fn_leftctrl 0-1)。すべての Apple キーボードに共"
"通"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Also write it to /etc/modprobe.d/hid_apple.conf"
msgstr "/etc/modprobe.d/hid_apple.conf にも書き込む"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Rename the keyboard on this computer (BlueZ alias; nothing is written into "
"the keyboard). With --device-name: the name stored IN the keyboard"
msgstr ""
"このコンピューター上でのキーボード名を変更 (BlueZ エイリアス。キーボードには"
"何も書き込みません)。--device-name 付き: キーボード内に保存された名前"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"TWO NAMES:\n"
"  akmctl rename <name>                 alias of THIS computer (BlueZ Alias): "
"nothing written into the keyboard\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name <name>   WRITES the name stored IN the "
"keyboard (seen by every host):\n"
"                                       pre-flight, backup of the current "
"name, ONE confirmation [y/N]\n"
"                                       (--yes skips it and works without a "
"terminal), one write, immediate\n"
"                                       read-back, verdict. No password in "
"the active local session.\n"
"                                       --check: whole pre-flight and backup, "
"nothing written, nothing asked\n"
"                                       --dry-run: shows the bytes, no "
"pkexec, nothing written\n"
"                                       --verbose: frames, wire bytes, proof, "
"[devname] journal\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name --show   name stored in the keyboard, from the "
"daemon's cache\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name --restore <backup.json> [--yes]   write a "
"backup back (same flow)\n"
"Exit codes of --device-name: 0 written and read back identical (or --check "
"green), 10 no terminal and\n"
"no --yes, 11 pre-flight refused, 12 cancelled, 13 written but not read back "
"(check with --show),\n"
"14 read back different (rollback command printed), 15 write uncertain (the "
"write failed on its way:\n"
"a frame may have been sent, check with --show). Persistence across a battery "
"change is not measured\n"
"(docs/RENAME-KEYBOARD.md)."
msgstr ""
"2 つの名前:\n"
"  akmctl rename <name>                 このコンピューターのエイリアス (BlueZ "
"Alias): キーボードには何も書き込まない\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name <name>   キーボード内に保存された名前を書き込"
"む (すべてのホストから見える):\n"
"                                       事前チェック、現在の名前のバックアッ"
"プ、確認 1 回 [y/N]\n"
"                                       (--yes で省略、端末なしでも動作)、書き"
"込み 1 回、直後の\n"
"                                       読み戻し、判定。アクティブなローカル"
"セッションではパスワード不要。\n"
"                                       --check: 事前チェックとバックアップの"
"み、書き込みも質問もしない\n"
"                                       --dry-run: バイト列を表示、pkexec な"
"し、書き込みなし\n"
"                                       --verbose: フレーム、送出バイト、証"
"跡、[devname] ジャーナル\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name --show   キーボード内に保存された名前 (サービス"
"のキャッシュから)\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name --restore <backup.json> [--yes]   バックアップ"
"を書き戻す (同じ手順)\n"
"--device-name の終了コード: 0 書き込み後に同一内容を読み戻し (または --check "
"が正常)、10 端末なしかつ\n"
"--yes なし、11 事前チェックで拒否、12 キャンセル、13 書き込んだが読み戻せず "
"(--show で確認)、\n"
"14 読み戻した内容が異なる (ロールバック用コマンドを表示)、15 書き込み不確定 "
"(書き込みが途中で失敗:\n"
"フレームが送信された可能性あり、--show で確認)。電池交換後の保持は測定してい"
"ません\n"
"(docs/RENAME-KEYBOARD.md)。"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "New alias (max 64 characters, no control characters)"
msgstr "新しいエイリアス (最大 64 文字、制御文字不可)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Restore the keyboard's own name"
msgstr "キーボード本来の名前に戻す"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Keyboard to rename (default: the one the daemon reports)"
msgstr "名前を変更するキーボード (既定: サービスが報告するもの)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Write the name stored IN the keyboard (printable ASCII, 1-32 characters); "
"without a value: with --show or --restore"
msgstr ""
"キーボード内に保存する名前を書き込む (印字可能な ASCII、1-32 文字)。値なしの"
"場合: --show または --restore と併用"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Do not ask the confirmation (works without a terminal)"
msgstr "確認を求めない (端末なしでも動作)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Show the bytes that would be sent, write nothing, no pkexec"
msgstr "送信されるバイト列を表示し、何も書き込まない。pkexec なし"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Whole pre-flight (control-channel MTU read via ONE pkexec, read-only) and "
"backup; nothing written, nothing asked"
msgstr ""
"事前チェック一式 (制御チャネルの MTU を pkexec 1 回で読み取り、読み取りのみ) "
"とバックアップ。書き込みも質問もしない"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Accepted for compatibility, no effect: --device-name writes by default"
msgstr ""
"互換性のために受け付けますが効果はありません: --device-name は既定で書き込み"
"ます"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Show the name stored in the keyboard (daemon cache, no hardware read)"
msgstr ""
"キーボード内に保存された名前を表示 (サービスのキャッシュ、ハードウェアは読み"
"取らない)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Write back a backup made by a previous --device-name run"
msgstr "以前の --device-name 実行で作成したバックアップを書き戻す"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Byte-by-byte detail (frames, wire, proof, [devname] journal)"
msgstr "バイト単位の詳細 (フレーム、送出、証跡、[devname] ジャーナル)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Follow StateChanged signals: one JSON line per change, until interrupted"
msgstr "StateChanged シグナルを追跡: 変更ごとに JSON を 1 行、中断されるまで"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Battery history (single store: $XDG_STATE_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/"
"history.jsonl)"
msgstr ""
"電池の履歴 (単一の保存先: $XDG_STATE_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/history.jsonl)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Oldest entry: 90m, 24h, 7d, 2w, YYYY-MM-DD or \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\" (UTC)"
msgstr ""
"最も古い項目: 90m、24h、7d、2w、YYYY-MM-DD または \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\" (UTC)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Newest entry (same formats)"
msgstr "最も新しい項目 (同じ形式)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Keep only the last N entries"
msgstr "最後の N 件のみ残す"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "JSON array on one line instead of the table"
msgstr "表の代わりに 1 行の JSON 配列"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Export the history on stdout"
msgstr "履歴を標準出力にエクスポート"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "CSV format (the only one; header included)"
msgstr "CSV 形式 (唯一の形式、ヘッダー付き)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Import a history file of the former Python CLI into the single store. The "
"source is not modified; existing lines are not duplicated"
msgstr ""
"旧 Python CLI の履歴ファイルを単一の保存先に取り込みます。元のファイルは変更"
"されず、既存の行は重複しません"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "File to import (history.jsonl of the Python CLI)"
msgstr "取り込むファイル (Python CLI の history.jsonl)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Terminal chart of the battery (percentage and voltage) over 24 h or 7 days"
msgstr "24 時間または 7 日間の電池 (パーセントと電圧) を端末にグラフ表示"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Time window"
msgstr "期間"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"JSON for a waybar/polybar custom module (classes: good, warning, critical, "
"disconnected)"
msgstr ""
"waybar/polybar のカスタムモジュール用 JSON (クラス: good、warning、critical、"
"disconnected)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Prometheus text exposition of the keyboard state (one page)"
msgstr "キーボードの状態を Prometheus テキスト形式で出力 (1 ページ)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Switch a keyboard LED (NumLock can only be switched off)"
msgstr "キーボードの LED を切り替える (NumLock はオフにのみ可能)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Ask the daemon to send WillShutdown (Feature 0x40, id only) to the keyboard, "
"as macOS does at shutdown: once, only if connected and `[apple] "
"will_shutdown` is on. Run by the shutdown unit"
msgstr ""
"macOS がシャットダウン時に行うように、サービスにキーボードへ WillShutdown "
"(Feature 0x40、id のみ) を送らせる: 接続中かつ `[apple] will_shutdown` が有効"
"な場合に 1 回のみ。シャットダウン用ユニットが実行します"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Do nothing unless the system is shutting down or restarting (`systemctl is-"
"system-running` = stopping): used by the unit, so that a logout or a service "
"restart never sends it"
msgstr ""
"システムがシャットダウンまたは再起動中でない限り何もしない (`systemctl is-"
"system-running` = stopping): ユニットが使用し、ログアウトやサービスの再起動で"
"は決して送信されないようにします"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Send HID_CONTROL SUSPEND (0x13) or EXIT_SUSPEND (0x14) to the connected "
"Apple keyboards, as macOS bluetoothd does at sleep and wake: one byte on the "
"HID control channel of bluetoothd, administrator authentication. The system "
"units send it by themselves at every sleep/wake; this is the manual test. --"
"dry-run writes nothing"
msgstr ""
"macOS の bluetoothd がスリープ時と復帰時に行うように、接続中の Apple キーボー"
"ドへ HID_CONTROL SUSPEND (0x13) または EXIT_SUSPEND (0x14) を送信: "
"bluetoothd の HID 制御チャネルで 1 バイト、管理者認証あり。システムユニットは"
"スリープ/復帰のたびに自動で送信します。これは手動テスト用です。--dry-run は何"
"も書き込みません"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"suspend: HID_CONTROL SUSPEND, byte 0x13 (what the suspend unit sends before "
"sleep); exit-suspend: HID_CONTROL EXIT_SUSPEND, byte 0x14 (what the resume "
"unit sends at wake)"
msgstr ""
"suspend: HID_CONTROL SUSPEND、バイト 0x13 (サスペンドユニットがスリープ前に送"
"るもの)。exit-suspend: HID_CONTROL EXIT_SUSPEND、バイト 0x14 (レジュームユ"
"ニットが復帰時に送るもの)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Only this keyboard (must be a connected Apple keyboard)"
msgstr "このキーボードのみ (接続中の Apple キーボードであること)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Show the bluetoothd socket that would be used (pid, fd, MAC, PSM, state) and "
"send nothing"
msgstr ""
"使用される bluetoothd のソケット (pid、fd、MAC、PSM、状態) を表示し、何も送信"
"しない"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Register map of the keyboard (every known HID report: name, size, safety "
"class) with the values the daemon has cached, \"never read\" otherwise. "
"Never reads the keyboard"
msgstr ""
"キーボードのレジスタマップ (既知のすべての HID レポート: 名前、サイズ、安全区"
"分) とサービスがキャッシュした値。値がなければ \"未読み取り\"。キーボードは決"
"して読み取りません"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Machine-readable JSON"
msgstr "機械可読な JSON"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Firmware version of the keyboard against the embedded table of Apple's "
"public firmware updates, where one exists (read once per connection by the "
"daemon; no network, never flashes)"
msgstr ""
"キーボードのファームウェアバージョンを、Apple の公開ファームウェアアップデー"
"トの内蔵表と照合 (該当があれば。サービスが接続ごとに 1 回読み取り、ネットワー"
"ク不使用、書き換えは一切しない)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Read the 3 allowed HID reports (0x47, 0x46, 0x49) with the safe read policy: "
"no scan, never 0x4C / 0xFE / 0x01. Press a key first (an idle keyboard is "
"left alone)"
msgstr ""
"許可された 3 つの HID レポート (0x47、0x46、0x49) を安全な読み取り方針で読み"
"取る: スキャンなし、0x4C / 0xFE / 0x01 は決して読まない。先にキーを押してくだ"
"さい (アイドル中のキーボードには触れません)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Diagnose the Bluetooth link in one command (BlueZ, pairing, adapter power "
"management, BlueZ/UPower configuration, journal, hidraw, daemon). Read-only "
"unless --fix; run with sudo to also compare the stored and kernel link keys"
msgstr ""
"Bluetooth 接続を 1 コマンドで診断 (BlueZ、ペアリング、アダプターの電源管理、"
"BlueZ/UPower の設定、ジャーナル、hidraw、サービス)。--fix なしでは読み取りの"
"み。sudo で実行すると保存済みとカーネルのリンクキーも比較します"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Keyboard to check (default: the paired one)"
msgstr "確認するキーボード (既定: ペアリング済みのもの)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Apply the corrections of the system files the diagnostic proposes (BlueZ "
"main.conf, udev rule of the adapter), through the privileged helper: one "
"administrator authentication, the previous file kept as <name>.akm-bak"
msgstr ""
"診断が提案するシステムファイルの修正 (BlueZ main.conf、アダプターの udev ルー"
"ル) を特権ヘルパー経由で適用: 管理者認証 1 回、以前のファイルは <name>.akm-"
"bak として保持"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "With --fix: show what would change, write nothing (no password)"
msgstr "--fix と併用: 変更内容を表示し、何も書き込まない (パスワード不要)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"With --fix: also restart bluetooth / upower so the corrected file is read "
"now (drops every Bluetooth link for a few seconds)"
msgstr ""
"--fix と併用: 修正したファイルをすぐ読み込ませるため bluetooth / upower も再"
"起動 (すべての Bluetooth 接続が数秒間切れます)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "With --fix: also apply the corrections marked \"optional\" (UPower)"
msgstr "--fix と併用: \"任意\" とされた修正 (UPower) も適用"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Guided repair of the link: wake + reconnect first; re-pair only after a "
"typed confirmation (the pairing is never removed otherwise)"
msgstr ""
"接続のガイド付き修復: まずウェイク + 再接続。再ペアリングは確認入力の後のみ "
"(それ以外でペアリングが削除されることはありません)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Keyboard to repair (default: the paired one)"
msgstr "修復するキーボード (既定: ペアリング済みのもの)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Offer re-pairing even if the link looks healthy"
msgstr "接続が正常に見えても再ペアリングを提案する"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Effective table of the special keys (F1-F12, Eject; --all: every known key): "
"physical key -> evdev code (after hwdb and hid_apple, per fnmode) -> keysym "
"-> KDE global shortcut. Never reads a key press, except with --live"
msgstr ""
"特殊キーの実効表 (F1-F12、Eject。--all: 既知のすべてのキー): 物理キー -> "
"evdev コード (hwdb と hid_apple の後、fnmode ごと) -> keysym -> KDE のグロー"
"バルショートカット。--live 以外ではキー入力を読み取りません"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Verdict per key ([ok] = a KDE shortcut is bound) and what to test"
msgstr "キーごとの判定 ([ok] = KDE ショートカットが割り当て済み) とテスト項目"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "All known keys (modifiers, arrows, Fn...), not only the top row"
msgstr "上段だけでなく既知のすべてのキー (修飾キー、矢印、Fn...)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Machine-readable JSON (with the KDE actions)"
msgstr "機械可読な JSON (KDE のアクション付き)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Live view of the key events of the Apple keyboard instead of the table: HID "
"usage, evdev code, name, one line per press and release. Reads the evdev "
"node (read-only, group \"input\"), records nothing. Leave with Escape held 2 "
"s, or Ctrl-C"
msgstr ""
"表の代わりに Apple キーボードのキーイベントをリアルタイム表示: HID usage、"
"evdev コード、名前、押下と解放ごとに 1 行。evdev ノードを読み取り (読み取りの"
"み、グループ \"input\")、何も記録しません。Escape を 2 秒押し続けるか Ctrl-C "
"で終了"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Manual key mapping without keyd ($XDG_CONFIG_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/"
"keymap.toml -> udev hwdb, installed with administrator authentication)"
msgstr ""
"keyd を使わない手動キー割り当て ($XDG_CONFIG_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/"
"keymap.toml -> udev hwdb、管理者認証でインストール)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Show the profiles of keymap.toml (--hwdb: the file `apply` would install)"
msgstr ""
"keymap.toml のプロファイルを表示 (--hwdb: `apply` がインストールするファイル)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Remap a key: KEY = F1..F12, Eject, Fn, LeftCmd... or a HID usage (0x7003a); "
"CODE = a KEY_* name of linux/input-event-codes.h. Applied by `apply`"
msgstr ""
"キーを再割り当て: KEY = F1..F12、Eject、Fn、LeftCmd... または HID usage "
"(0x7003a)。CODE = linux/input-event-codes.h の KEY_* 名。`apply` で適用"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Profile to edit (default: the active one)"
msgstr "編集するプロファイル (既定: アクティブなもの)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Back to the kernel mapping for one key (in keymap.toml)"
msgstr "1 つのキーをカーネルのキー割り当てに戻す (keymap.toml 内)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Preset of a profile (hid_apple parameters): apple (Apple legend, fnmode=1 "
"swap_opt_cmd=0), fkeys (F1-F12 first, fnmode=2), linux-pc (Cmd<->Alt, "
"swap_opt_cmd=1), none (parameters left as they are, the default)"
msgstr ""
"プロファイルのプリセット (hid_apple パラメーター): apple (Apple の刻印、"
"fnmode=1 swap_opt_cmd=0)、fkeys (F1-F12 優先、fnmode=2)、linux-pc (Cmd<-"
">Alt、swap_opt_cmd=1)、none (パラメーターはそのまま、既定)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Select the active profile (created with the apple preset if new)"
msgstr "アクティブなプロファイルを選択 (新規なら apple プリセットで作成)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Install the active profile: udev hwdb (akm-helper install-keymap) and "
"hid_apple parameters (akm-helper, persistent, ALL Apple keyboards)"
msgstr ""
"アクティブなプロファイルをインストール: udev hwdb (akm-helper install-"
"keymap) と hid_apple パラメーター (akm-helper、永続、すべての Apple キーボー"
"ド)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Show what would change, change nothing"
msgstr "変更内容を表示し、何も変更しない"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Remove the installed hwdb (kernel mapping back at once) and clear the keys "
"of the active profile"
msgstr ""
"インストール済みの hwdb を削除 (カーネルのキー割り当てに即時復帰) し、アク"
"ティブなプロファイルのキーを消去"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Restore the previously installed hwdb file"
msgstr "以前インストールされていた hwdb ファイルを復元"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Add the KDE shortcuts the Apple legend needs and KDE lacks (F4 = Launch (D) "
"-> application launcher), never replacing a binding"
msgstr ""
"Apple の刻印に必要で KDE に欠けているショートカットを追加 (F4 = Launch (D) "
"-> アプリケーションランチャー)。既存の割り当ては置き換えません"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Remove exactly the keys kde-apply added"
msgstr "kde-apply が追加したキーだけを削除"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Health self-check (daemon, link, journal, crashes, disk), run by apple-kb-"
"monitor-selfcheck.timer"
msgstr ""
"ヘルス自己診断 (サービス、接続、ジャーナル、クラッシュ、ディスク)。apple-kb-"
"monitor-selfcheck.timer が実行"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print the result as JSON (the same object as selfcheck.json)"
msgstr "結果を JSON で出力 (selfcheck.json と同じオブジェクト)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Desktop notification for each NEW grave problem (deduplicated)"
msgstr "新たな重大問題ごとにデスクトップ通知 (重複なし)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Also open one Gitea issue per new grave problem (deduplicated; needs "
"AKM_GITEA_API, AKM_GITEA_REPO and ~/.config/gitea/token). Off by default"
msgstr ""
"新たな重大問題ごとに Gitea の issue も 1 件作成 (重複なし。AKM_GITEA_API、"
"AKM_GITEA_REPO、~/.config/gitea/token が必要)。既定ではオフ"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Result file (default: $XDG_STATE_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/selfcheck.json)"
msgstr "結果ファイル (既定: $XDG_STATE_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/selfcheck.json)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Do not write the result file (dry run)"
msgstr "結果ファイルを書き込まない (ドライラン)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print a shell completion script on stdout"
msgstr "シェル補完スクリプトを標準出力に出力"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print the manual page (roff) on stdout"
msgstr "マニュアルページ (roff) を標準出力に出力"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid ""
"Two names exist:\n"
"* alias on THIS computer (BlueZ Alias): `akmctl rename <name>`, the default, "
"no risk, nothing written into the keyboard;\n"
"* name stored IN the keyboard (firmware, reports 0x51-0x54 / 0x55), seen by "
"every host: `akmctl rename --device-name`.\n"
msgstr ""
"名前は 2 つあります:\n"
"* このコンピューター上のエイリアス (BlueZ Alias): `akmctl rename <name>`。既"
"定、リスクなし、キーボードには何も書き込みません。\n"
"* キーボード内に保存された名前 (ファームウェア、レポート 0x51-0x54 / 0x55)。"
"すべてのホストから見えます: `akmctl rename --device-name`。\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Refused: --mac {mac} is not the keyboard the daemon follows ({daemon}), so "
"its pre-flight state and current name are unknown. Nothing was touched.\n"
msgstr ""
"拒否: --mac {mac} はサービスが追跡しているキーボード ({daemon}) ではないた"
"め、事前状態と現在の名前が不明です。何も変更していません。\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Alias (this computer):"
msgstr "エイリアス (このコンピューター):"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "(none)"
msgstr "(なし)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Stored in the keyboard (0x51-0x54, daemon cache):"
msgstr "キーボード内に保存 (0x51-0x54、サービスのキャッシュ):"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "bytes:"
msgstr "バイト列:"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid ""
"Stored in the keyboard: not read yet in this connection (the daemon reads "
"0x51-0x54 once per connection; no new hardware read is made here)\n"
msgstr ""
"キーボード内に保存: この接続ではまだ未読み取り (サービスは接続ごとに "
"0x51-0x54 を 1 回読み取ります。ここでハードウェアの新たな読み取りは行いませ"
"ん)\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Proof of the sequence:"
msgstr "シーケンスの証跡:"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Settled by disassembly (docs/RENAME-KEYBOARD.md):"
msgstr "逆アセンブルで確定 (docs/RENAME-KEYBOARD.md):"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Measured on the keyboard (firmware 0x0050):\n"
msgstr "キーボードで測定 (ファームウェア 0x0050):\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Not measured:\n"
msgstr "未測定:\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Experiments:\n"
msgstr "実験:\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid ""
"Frame sent (the one of Lion 10.7.5 setDeviceName:, established by "
"disassembly):"
msgstr ""
"送信フレーム (Lion 10.7.5 の setDeviceName: のもの、逆アセンブルで確定):"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Pre-flight: ok (doctor green, battery {battery} %, breaker closed, outgoing "
"MTU {mtu} >= {min})\n"
msgstr ""
"事前チェック: ok (doctor 正常、電池 {battery} %、ブレーカー閉、送信 MTU "
"{mtu} >= {min})\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Pre-flight: ok (doctor green, battery {battery} %, breaker closed)\n"
msgstr "事前チェック: ok (doctor 正常、電池 {battery} %、ブレーカー閉)\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Pre-flight: ok (doctor green, breaker closed, outgoing MTU {mtu} >= {min})\n"
msgstr ""
"事前チェック: ok (doctor 正常、ブレーカー閉、送信 MTU {mtu} >= {min})\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Pre-flight: ok (doctor green, breaker closed)\n"
msgstr "事前チェック: ok (doctor 正常、ブレーカー閉)\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid ""
"Refused: no terminal to confirm. Add --yes to write without the question. "
"Nothing was touched.\n"
msgstr ""
"拒否: 確認用の端末がありません。質問なしで書き込むには --yes を付けてくださ"
"い。何も変更していません。\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "name refused:"
msgstr "名前を拒否:"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "New name stored in the keyboard:"
msgstr "キーボード内に保存する新しい名前:"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid ""
"\n"
"DRY RUN: nothing is written to the keyboard.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ドライラン: キーボードには何も書き込みません。\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Pre-flight: FAILED -"
msgstr "事前チェック: 失敗 -"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Pre-flight: control-channel MTU not probed in a dry run (needs pkexec); with "
"--check or when writing it is probed and must be >= {min}\n"
msgstr ""
"事前チェック: ドライランでは制御チャネルの MTU を調べません (pkexec が必"
"要)。--check 時または書き込み時に調べ、{min} 以上である必要があります\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Backup of the current name:"
msgstr "現在の名前のバックアップ:"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Backup: FAILED -"
msgstr "バックアップ: 失敗 -"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid ""
"Backup: not possible yet (the daemon has not read 0x51-0x54 in this "
"connection)\n"
msgstr ""
"バックアップ: まだできません (この接続でサービスがまだ 0x51-0x54 を読み取って"
"いません)\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Pre-flight: daemon unavailable"
msgstr "事前チェック: サービスを利用できません"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid ""
"\n"
"To write: the same command without --dry-run (one confirmation [y/N], or --"
"yes). To check everything without writing: --check.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"書き込むには: --dry-run を外した同じコマンド (確認 1 回 [y/N]、または --"
"yes)。書き込まずにすべて確認するには: --check。\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "backup refused:"
msgstr "バックアップを拒否:"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Backup {file}: name {name}, keyboard {mac}, saved at {when}\n"
msgstr "バックアップ {file}: 名前 {name}、キーボード {mac}、保存日時 {when}\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid ""
"DRY RUN: nothing written. Without --dry-run, the backup is written back into "
"the keyboard (one confirmation [y/N], or --yes).\n"
msgstr ""
"ドライラン: 何も書き込んでいません。--dry-run なしでは、バックアップがキー"
"ボードに書き戻されます (確認 1 回 [y/N]、または --yes)。\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "daemon unavailable:"
msgstr "サービスを利用できません:"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "control-channel MTU unknown:"
msgstr "制御チャネルの MTU が不明:"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Name stored in the keyboard:"
msgstr "キーボード内に保存された名前:"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "(not read yet)"
msgstr "(未読み取り)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Write “{target}” into the keyboard's memory? [y/N] "
msgstr "「{target}」をキーボードのメモリーに書き込みますか? [y/N] "

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Stopped: the hidraw node did not open ({d}). Nothing was written.\n"
msgstr ""
"中止: hidraw ノードを開けませんでした ({d})。何も書き込んでいません。\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "RereadName refused by the daemon:"
msgstr "サービスが RereadName を拒否:"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid ""
"  BlueZ may show the old name until a later connection; persistence across a "
"battery change is not measured.\n"
msgstr ""
"  BlueZ は次回以降の接続まで古い名前を表示することがあります。電池交換後の保"
"持は測定していません。\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid "Pre-flight refused, nothing was written:\n"
msgstr "事前チェックで拒否、何も書き込んでいません:\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Refused: this backup is of keyboard {backup}, the target keyboard is "
"{target}. Nothing was touched.\n"
msgstr ""
"拒否: このバックアップはキーボード {backup} のもので、対象のキーボードは "
"{target} です。何も変更していません。\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
msgid ""
"✓ --check: pre-flight green, backup made, nothing was written, nothing was "
